        "product_accordion_TzedtM": {
          "type": "product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Overview",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<p>Our cotton-linen Sofa Toppers provide a sleek, breathable alternative to traditional couch covers, offering subtle protection without compromising the aesthetic of your furniture. </p><p>Perfect for dog parents, these toppers feature a waterproof liner to shield sofas and soft furnishings from pet wear, muddy paws, accidents, and pet hair, all while preserving the style of your home.</p><p>Made from a durable linen-cotton blend, our Sofa Toppers are machine washable and thick enough to protect against dog scratching and digging. The topper design makes them an ideal solution for those seeking practical, stylish furniture protection without the bulk of a traditional couch cover.</p><p>Versatile and adaptable, the Sofa Topper works not only on sofas but also on beds, chairs, in the car, as a comfy floor mat, and for pet-friendly accommodations on the go.</p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 8
          }
        },
