          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Materials and Care",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<p></p><p><strong>Fabric Cover</strong></p><ul><li>55% Linen 45% Cotton</li><li>325gsm heavyweight fabric</li><li>Invisible YKK Zip</li><li>Machine washable </li></ul><p><strong>Inner Materials</strong></p><ul><li>Waterproof / liquid-resistant liner</li><li>Eco-friendly polycluster fibre filling </li></ul><p><strong>Detailing</strong> </p><ul><li>Reversible</li><li>Fringed edging </li></ul><p><strong>Care</strong></p><ul><li>Sofa Topper Fabric covers are zip-removable and machine washable for easy care. </li><li>Machine wash up to 30ºC on a cold, gentle cycle using mild liquid detergent.</li><li>Air dry, or limit tumble-drying to low or delicate settings </li><li>Do not bleach, iron or dry-clean, and if your linen happens to stain, launder. Spot-clean marks immediately.</li></ul>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 8
