            "image": "shopify://shop_images/KOOZI-CAMPAIGN-352.jpg",
            "title": "Use it Anywhere",
            "text": "<p>Use it across your sofa base, fold it for smaller areas, drape over armrests, or position vertically for L-shaped sofas or lounge chairs. Practical and breathable, it also works as a bed throw, travel mat, or cosy floor topper</p>",
