            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Sofa_Topper_Details_Dove_Grey.jpg",
            "title": "Scratch-Proof Protection",
            "text": "<p>Scratch-proof protection for your furniture’s high-use areas. The thick, heavyweight fabric acts as a durable shield from scratching and digging,  extending the life of your sofa.</p>",
