          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/KOOZI-CAMPAIGN-256_1.jpg",
            "title": "No More Sticky Pet Hair",
            "text": "<p>Minimise the need for constantly wiping away hair after your dog naps. Our natural fabric topper is non-static, meaning hair is less prone to sticking and can easily be lint rolled. </p>",
